<span class="text-accent">&gt; Non-negotiable engineering directives for AI coding agents.</span>

<span class="text-highlight">1. Minimal Touch Surgery:</span>
   Modify exclusively the files assigned to the task.
   Never rewrite or reformat adjacent working modules.

<span class="text-highlight">2. Strict Fail-Fast:</span>
   Never wrap logic in defensive try/catch blocks
   that swallow exceptions or silently return dummy nulls.

<span class="text-highlight">3. Zero Parrot Comments:</span>
   Never add comments that merely narrate code syntax.
   Code must be self-explanatory with clean naming.</code></pre>
